3. Third-party components and benchmark materials
-----------------------------------------------

Third-party components retain their own licenses and copyright notices.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES and THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/ for component details.

The MIT license for evaluation code does not cover target libraries or other
